{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_018ele_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_018ele_003_1000_p", "source_sha256": "53dd888e94d801901af8d82dd8439bd2b1c5ba19cc1d17c0e0887e55773730ca", "ja": "（今日はエレナの初舞台だ。\nそろそろ出番だから、呼びに行かないとな）", "zh": "（今天是艾琳娜第一次登上舞台。\n差不多要轮到她出场了，我得去叫她。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_018ele_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_018ele_003_1001_018ele", "source_sha256": "64edd94572602489daff4ba0f45e3c15ea61ff67f0d5ffaf879a5953e87f7b09", "ja": "うー……。ドキドキするヨ……。", "zh": "呜……心跳得好快喔……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_018ele_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_018ele_003_1002_p", "source_sha256": "c9630e078588973f8465edb9952716c31a3d48f1751bd22a05c7cba1701fc82f", "ja": "エレナ、準備はできて…って、どうしたんだ？\nまさか、胸が痛いのか？", "zh": "艾琳娜，你准备好……咦，怎么啦？\n难道胸口会痛吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_018ele_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_018ele_003_1003_018ele", "source_sha256": "b1ebc7377edc70572ee221d2c767b55169d909618b39544706f60e157cc19e25", "ja": "{$P$}……。\nううん、どこも痛くないヨ。", "zh": "{$P$}……\n不是，我没有哪里痛喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_018ele_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_018ele_003_1004_018ele", "source_sha256": "4c14338c994819136f7558bbc86861a0675511957d0536b8cec7c59cb2d82af6", "ja": "ただ、さっきからドキドキが止まらなくて……。", "zh": "只是，从刚才开始心就跳得好快……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_018ele_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_018ele_003_1005_p", "source_sha256": "c3b22b6e57ac483d8de815b325705b2c826f378518a0d33182f08297cdd2a35d", "ja": "今日はエレナにとって、初めてのステージだもんな。\n大丈夫か？", "zh": "毕竟今天是艾琳娜第一次登台表演嘛。\n你还好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_018ele_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_018ele_003_1006_018ele", "source_sha256": "a12650d7a15b5190201d3de6a9c6cca8935a39486d8f9718f6175bd1ee1342ea", "ja": "ウン。初めてっていうのもあるけど、\n今日はワタシだけじゃないでしょ？", "zh": "嗯。虽然的确是第一次，\n但今天我不是一个人对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_018ele_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_018ele_003_1007_p", "source_sha256": "3474ff40d3f6e5bdd9d2c5a23406f993083736ffaa3c7eaea83a6c8d33a7a31a", "ja": "ん？　ああ、劇場のみんなも一緒だな。", "zh": "嗯？是啊，剧场的伙伴们也会跟你一起上台。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_018ele_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_018ele_003_1008_018ele", "source_sha256": "d551905eb6dd4b71b947850adaccaea3c1171e1d2471f479b7a0ae62a3e724fd", "ja": "でもワタシ、今まで決められた通りに踊ったコトなんて\nなかったから。ちゃんと覚えてるか不安だヨ……。", "zh": "不过我以前都没有照编排的舞步来跳过。\n不知道有没有记好……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_018ele_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_018ele_003_1009_018ele", "source_sha256": "784587ed22248f781f8a3b3519241f80b186549bcf101e181e539c087ae44e1a", "ja": "{$P$}、どうしよう？\nワタシ、ちゃんとみんなを笑顔にできるかナ？", "zh": "{$P$}，怎么办？\n我真的能带给大家笑容吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_018ele_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_018ele_003_1010_p", "source_sha256": "170961092cf3d65bb5910735f0c3c74ef9ee70f7d656a00de8499d5ad8878096", "ja": "エレナ……。", "zh": "艾琳娜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_018ele_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_018ele_003_1011_018ele", "source_sha256": "1e513e50f45661cd79fb4f6e7618fcdccb0fedefe16a6ff546dd5dbf6ac4e1d7", "ja": "もしワタシが失敗しちゃったら、お客さんも、\n他のみんなも楽しくなくなっちゃう……どうしよう？", "zh": "如果我失败了，\n观众和其他人都会不开心……怎么办？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_018ele_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_018ele_003_1012", "source_sha256": "7961b2bdbe36b2790ae12b8f0dccd9fa5139f7bb123d8f7c56793d2998030fa1", "ja": "肩を叩く", "zh": "拍拍肩膀", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_018ele_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_018ele_003_2000_p", "source_sha256": "add7db99f584db1f47119897b06ea59702733362b45980a1422dbaf1bad8ff2e", "ja": "エレナ、ちょっと落ち着こう。\nみんなとのレッスンはどうだった？　辛かったか？", "zh": "艾琳娜，你冷静一下。\n你觉得之前和大家一起进行的训练怎么样？很辛苦吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_018ele_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_018ele_003_2001_018ele", "source_sha256": "63a0fa0bfe4eb106d289365c8b5394ab9ff38c55b91ba1360791ad4a73cbd1f3", "ja": "ううん！\nすっごく楽しかったヨ！", "zh": "不会！\n非常好玩喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_018ele_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_018ele_003_2002_018ele", "source_sha256": "a7cbfcf6fd9b4d5c7fa6a047564c356998893e65004fd65e373579ef42d2aa5b", "ja": "大変なコトもあったけど、初めてのコトが\nたくさんあって……毎日が刺激的だったヨ！", "zh": "虽然有时很难，\n但是有很多我第一次接触的事……每天都很刺激喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_018ele_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_018ele_003_2003_p", "source_sha256": "abe2c3ab04e98124e0b2477c4a55178ddd0e469b66afe5d03f1f4b04fbfa3850", "ja": "その気持ちを、表現してみればいいんじゃないかな。\nきっと、あのサンバの時と同じだ。", "zh": "那你把这种心情表现出来，应该就没问题了。\n这肯定就像之前你跳森巴时一样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_018ele_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_018ele_003_2004_018ele", "source_sha256": "74cc004e8644abf8dbde535bbc045d336080f64c1d9364690b293c0fa6ee9f50", "ja": "サンバの時と……？", "zh": "跳森巴时……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_018ele_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_018ele_003_2005_p", "source_sha256": "426ca05fda5a1223a3bc9336e5ed5bf597323f8cd05809b59b9740940bceb493", "ja": "ああ。エレナの楽しい気持ち、みんなも楽しんでほしい\nっていう気持ちは、きっとお客さんに伝わるはずだ。", "zh": "是呀。艾琳娜自己开心的心情，\n以及想让大家乐在其中的心意，观众们一定感受得到。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_018ele_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_018ele_003_2006_018ele", "source_sha256": "7846191eb8d8173f68958d3610c2bbae2c67ae793e65e57a2dbb1384611ec5a9", "ja": "そっか……。そうだよネ！", "zh": "这样啊……说得也是！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_018ele_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_018ele_003_2007_018ele", "source_sha256": "f9685c062d413d763a04c868288a9108b39bcb76d3216c2760b86a4865df2ac0", "ja": "ワタシが楽しい気持ちじゃないと、\nみんなも楽しいって思わないよネ？", "zh": "如果我不开心的话，\n大家也不会开心吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_018ele_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_018ele_003_2008_p", "source_sha256": "1118875f7903d0d079f75c0d5abc3fef26f015b54b8924c330becbf3c7151fbb", "ja": "その通りだ。それにもし失敗しても、\nエレナには仲間がいるだろう？", "zh": "就是这样。而且就算失败了，\n艾琳娜身边还有伙伴呀！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_018ele_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_018ele_003_2009_p", "source_sha256": "aedc530c98cb0ca40c35f45403a79052e120c37580837a23380162c0ca8f702d", "ja": "困ったときは、お互いに助け合える。\nだから安心して、楽しい気持ちになってくるといい。", "zh": "伤脑筋时，大家也都会互相帮助。\n所以你就安下心来，开心享受吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_018ele_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_018ele_003_2010_018ele", "source_sha256": "6f08c8fde02f9b4ff2d6a99ca37d2939e91d3dc2a4437c4ba275bb3207e2fb85", "ja": "仲間……。", "zh": "伙伴……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_018ele_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_018ele_003_2011_p", "source_sha256": "80b04f44b9bd1e97ba3c17d26e425f64fc0ce443a606555578607b1a8a67e1ae", "ja": "ほら、もうすぐ開演だ。いつものエレナらしく、\nのびのび楽しく踊ってこい！", "zh": "来，快要开演了。就跟平常的艾琳娜一样，\n去轻松自在地开心跳舞吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_018ele_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_018ele_003_2012_018ele", "source_sha256": "2a63e2ff9d3f7d9fc8e5a7e2c687070e7b42810c8f19ba244ff19ed8cfd68c95", "ja": "{$P$}……わかったヨ！\nワタシ、思いっきり楽しんでくるネ！", "zh": "{$P$}……我知道了！\n我会去尽情享受的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_018ele_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_018ele_003_2013_018ele", "source_sha256": "ef5d97f62b217ed3270c422fba61f4e75eca973e0748ceab8ed3bae58dd0cd62", "ja": "ありがとー！　おかげで、すごくスッキリしたヨ。\nいってきまーす♪", "zh": "谢谢你──！多亏你的鼓励，我现在好多了。\n我走了～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_018ele_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_018ele_003_2014_p", "source_sha256": "35f9039c6f351abb48568295bdb292eec148c50b72e8063d795aec09d0ad9b0a", "ja": "（ようやく、いつもの笑顔を取り戻した。これなら\nきっと、ステージを太陽のように照らせるだろう！）", "zh": "（她终于恢复平时太阳般的笑容了。这样一来，\n她一定能像太阳一样，照亮整个舞台！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
